<section id="method" class="app-section">
  <div class="app-shell">
    <div class="app-head">
      <h2 class="h2-sm">From how you coach<br><span class="accent">to a runner's Tuesday.</span></h2>
      <p>A method is your whole approach, named after you. Runners subscribe to a tier built on it, and the weeks they train come out of it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="app-flow">
      <li>
        <h3>Write it</h3>
        <p>A public summary that runners read before they subscribe, and a private methodology that only the AI reads. Every edit is saved as a version.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Back it up</h3>
        <p>Add up to 20 private sources per method, such as your notes, your session rules and your taper. The AI draws on them when it drafts a block or a plan.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Publish a tier</h3>
        <p>Running, strength or both. Runners subscribe in the app and on the coaching page of this site, pay monthly and train two weeks at a time.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Approve every block</h3>
        <p>Every two weeks the app drafts a runner's next block from your plan and how the last one went. Edit it, approve it or send it back with a note. Nothing reaches their calendar until you approve.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="workspace" class="app-section">
  <div class="app-shell">
    <div class="app-head">
