        <h3>Plans for one runner</h3>
        <p>Assign an individual plan to any subscriber and write down why. With their permission you see eight weeks of their training and fourteen days of recovery data.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="app-cell app-cell-card app-cell-wide">
        <h3>Block reviews</h3>
        <p>One queue of the blocks waiting for you, with the ones starting soon marked. Each shows how the last two weeks went, session by session: done or skipped, effort, feeling and the runner's notes. Rename, resize, remove or add sessions, then approve or ask for a redraft.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="app-cell">
        <h3>AI plan builder</h3>
        <p>Describe the runner, the race and the weeks available. It drafts a plan in your method for you to edit, keep or throw away.</p>
      </article>
