        <h3>Workout builder</h3>
        <p>Build runs step by step and strength as sets and reps. The workout player reads the steps out to the runner.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="app-cell app-cell-red">
        <h3>Opt-in only</h3>
        <p>Fitness and recovery data reach you only when a runner turns sharing on. Their notes, effort and feeling on your sessions come with every block.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="app-cell">
        <h3>Session threads</h3>
        <p>Every session has its own comment thread, and what runners write there comes to you with their next block.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="app-cell">
        <h3>Store editor</h3>
        <p>Write what each tier includes and choose which ones are open. The coaching page shows them as you publish them.</p>
